keywords:
  - basal ganglia
  - action selection
  - neurorobotics
  - computational neuroscience
  - Khepera
  - PyBullet
abstract: >
  A Python/PyBullet port of the basal ganglia model by Prescott et al.
  (2006), implementing the embedded action selection architecture (EASA)
  with the real geometry of the Khepera I robot and its gripper, running
  the original foraging task under a modern rigid-body physics engine.

